{"2545710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tony Hawk's™ Pro Skater™ 3 + 4", "steam_appid": 2545710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545710/extras/8939b24fe18deb10eb4e8aae5dafd496.avif?t=1771354447\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545710/extras_big/8939b24fe18deb10eb4e8aae5dafd496.avif?t=1771354447 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase the Digital Deluxe Edition to skate as the Doom Slayer and rip and tear through a ton of additional content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Digital Deluxe Edition includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Doom Slayer and The Revenant playable skaters, each includes 2 secret moves. The Doom Slayer includes 2 unique outfits and the Unmaykr Hoverboard skate deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional songs included with the in-game soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive Doom Slayer, Revenant, and Create-a-Skater skate decks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive themed Create-a-Skater Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wireframe Tony Shader</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hyped for the legendary franchise to return with Tony Hawk’s™ Pro Skater™ 3 + 4. Everything you loved is back, but revamped with more skaters, new parks, gnarlier tricks, eardrum shattering music, plus a whole lot more.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reunite the crew with cross-platform online Multiplayer* for up to 8 skaters in new and returning game modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop in to new parks or tear it up across the timeless parks from both Tony Hawk’s™ Pro Skater™ 3 &amp; Tony Hawk’s™ Pro Skater™ 4, authentically remade in jaw dropping 4K** resolution with streamlined goals and the epic 2-minute format.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit ‘em with some drip in the expanded Create-A-Skater and Create-A-Park modes, including the ability to create custom goals to share with friends for the first time ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shred harder than ever with more challenging goals and an enhanced New Game+ mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a total casual or a grungy pro, the same smooth handling and simple-to-learn controls from Tony Hawk’s™ Pro Skater™ 1 + 2 will have you shredding like a Pro.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alert the neighborhood watch and grab your skate buddies because the shred’s not dead. It’s back and better than ever.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hyped for the legendary franchise to return with Tony Hawk’s™ Pro Skater™ 3 + 4. Everything you loved is back, but revamped with more skaters, new parks, gnarlier tricks, eardrum shattering music, plus a whole lot more.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reunite the crew with cross-platform online Multiplayer* for up to 8 skaters in new and returning game modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop in to new parks or tear it up across the timeless parks from both Tony Hawk’s™ Pro Skater™ 3 &amp; Tony Hawk’s™ Pro Skater™ 4, authentically remade in jaw dropping 4K** resolution with streamlined goals and the epic 2-minute format.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit ‘em with some drip in the expanded Create-A-Skater and Create-A-Park modes, including the ability to create custom goals to share with friends for the first time ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shred harder than ever with more challenging goals and an enhanced New Game+ mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a total casual or a grungy pro, the same smooth handling and simple-to-learn controls from Tony Hawk’s™ Pro Skater™ 1 + 2 will have you shredding like a Pro.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alert the neighborhood watch and grab your skate buddies because the shred’s not dead. It’s back and better than ever.</p>", "short_description": "Get hyped for the legendary franchise to return with Tony Hawk’s™ Pro Skater™ 3 + 4. Everything you loved is back, but revamped with more skaters, new parks, gnarlier tricks, eardrum shattering music, plus a whole lot more.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545710/header.jpg?t=1771354447", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545710/d2219a3dd7c23969425fa79a0a8310f67b703212/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771354447", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545710/d2219a3dd7c23969425fa79a0a8310f67b703212/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771354447", "website": "https://www.tonyhawkthegame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 64 Bit (latest update)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD FX 6300 / Intel® Core™ i3-4340<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD HD 7950 / NVIDIA® GTX 660<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 55 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Widescreen support 21:9 / Remappable controls / Uncapped frame-rate / G-Sync / Freesync support</li></ul>",